Title: souldew

Summary: Nuzlocke tracker overlays

Description: |
  souldew for Nintendo 3DS: tracks your Nuzlocke while you play (first encounter
  per area, dupes, deaths, level caps) and shows short overlays at the important
  moments. SELECT or the bottom-right corner opens souldew's screens.

Compatibility: Any

MemorySize: 5MiB

UsePrivateMemory: false
